  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Service Delivery- Private- Population Services International (PSI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continue to implement activities in the communities where partners are already present in Punjab, Sindh and Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (KPK) Provinces, through a total market approach that reinforces access to and uptake of quality family planning (FP) products and services and strengthens the enabling environment through enhanced private sector engagement. Implementing Partner: Population Services International</narrative>
  </description>
